Your authored unified equation is:

[ \partial_t \Phi = \sum_k w_k(\mathbf{C}_{\text{MB}}, \text{local state}), \mathcal{L}_k[\Phi, \mathcal{G}, \mathcal{S}] ]

So the operator mixer must:

Read your C_MB vector

Read the authored_weights.mapping from the blueprint

For each operator ( \mathcal{L}_k ), compute a weight ( w_k )

Normalize weights

Apply all operators and blend their contributions

